{"page":215,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:54","surah":10,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّ لِكُلِّ نَفْسٍ ظَلَمَتْ مَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ لَٱفْتَدَتْ بِهِۦ ۗ وَأَسَرُّوا۟ ٱلنَّدَامَةَ لَمَّا رَأَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ ۖ وَقُضِىَ بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۚ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Every soul that has done evil, if it possessed all that is on the earth, would gladly offer it as ransom. When they see the punishment, they will repent in secret, but they will be judged with justice and will not be wronged.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"for every","transliteration":"likulli","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَلَمَتْ","en_gloss":"(that) wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamat","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَٱفْتَدَتْ","en_gloss":"it (would) seek to ransom","transliteration":"la-if'tadat","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَسَرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and they (will) confide","transliteration":"wa-asarrū","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","en_gloss":"the regret","transliteration":"l-nadāmata","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَمَّا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"lammā","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَأَوُا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"ra-awū","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"10:54"},{"pos":1